- Script to install Monero Ocean:
just add your Wallet address and copy this Line

curl -s -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MoneroOcean/xmrig_setup/master/setup_moneroocean_miner.sh | bash -s {YourWalletAddress}

- To Unimstall Moneroocean:

chmod +x uninstall_moneroocean.sh
./uninstall_moneroocean.sh



sudo apt-get install curl
mkdir -p ~/moneroocean && cd ~/moneroocean
url=$(curl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/MoneroOcean/xmrig/releases/latest | grep browser_download_url | grep -E 'lin64-compat|lin64\.tar\.gz' | head -1 | cut -d '"' -f 4)
curl -L "$url" -o xmrig.tar.gz && tar xf xmrig.tar.gz && chmod +x xmrig
